ng Electro DMG.\n\nParry Stance\n\nHold Normal Attack to enter Parry Stance at the cost of STA.\nWhile active, Rover is immune to interruptions, takes 60% less DMG, and continuously consumes STA. Release Normal Attack to exit Parry Stance and perform Basic Attack - Riposte Strike, dealing Electro DMG.\nIf an attack hits Rover during a certain period of Basic Attack - Riposte Strike, neutralize this attack and temporarily Stagnate the target before performing Basic Attack - Riposte Strike: Crumble, dealing Electro DMG.\nPress Normal Attack shortly after casting Basic Attack - Riposte Strike to cast Basic Attack Stage 2.\nPress Normal Attack shortly after casting Basic Attack - Riposte Strike: Crumble to cast Mid-air Attack - Havoc\nIn Parry Stance, use Dodge to consume STA to perform Dodge: Flicker, which can trigger successful Dodges during the action of this skill shortly after it's cast.\n\nMid-air Attack\n\nConsume STA to perform a Plunging Attack from mid-air, dealing Electro DMG.\n\nMid-air Attack - Havoc\n\nPerform up to 3 consecutive strikes, dealing Havoc DMG. Press Normal Attack shortly after casting Stage 3 of this skill to perform Basic Attack - Repel.\n\nDodge Counter\n\nPress Normal Attack right after a successful Dodge to attack the target, dealing Electro DMG.\nPress Normal Attack shortly after to perform Basic Attack Stage 3.\n\nMid-air Dodge Counter\n\nPress Normal Attack right after a successful Dodge in mid-air to perform Plunging Attack at the cost of STA, dealing Electro DMG.","actionIds":[1309001,1309002,1309003,1309004,1309005,1309006,1309007,1309008,1309040,1309041,1309042,1309043]},{"id":1005502,"type":"skill","name":"Thunderclap","description":"Launch the Cloudrift Bolt and grapple towards the target, dealing Electro DMG. Press Normal Attack shortly after to cast Basic Attack - Repel, dealing Electro DMG, considered Basic Attack DMG.","actionIds":[1309013,1309014]},{"id":1005503,"type":"liberation","name":"Ultimate Tactics","description":"Launch the Thunder Quietus, dealing Electro DMG.","actionIds":[1309016]},{"id":1005504,"type":"inherent","name":"Decipher","description":"Resonance Skill Overshock inflicts 10 stacks of Electro Flare on the target it damages.","actionIds":[]},{"id":1005505,"type":"inherent","name":"Regression","description":"When Resonance Skill Overshock is cast by holding down the button, gain 20% Resonance Skill DMG Bonus for 20s. Switching to another Resonator ends this effect.","actionIds":[]},{"id":1005506,"type":"intro","name":"Thunderous Fury","description":"Attack the target, dealing Electro DMG.","actionIds":[1309020]},{"id":1005507,"type":"forte","name":"Myriad Omens' Mandate","description":"Overshock\n\nAt max Electric Surge, Resonance Skill is replaced with Resonance Skill Overshock, dealing Electro DMG.\nPress Normal Attack shortly after casting this skill to perform Normal Attack Stage 4.\nThis skill can be cast in mid-air.\nIf Resonance Skill Overshock is cast by pressing the button, clear all Electric Surge to grant Resonators in the team 10% ATK Bonus for 20s.\nIf Resonance Skill Overshock is cast by holding down the button, consume 60 points of Concerto Energy to deal damage, then clear all Electric Surge to enter Apex Resonance.\n\nApex Resonance\n\nWhile in Apex Resonance, Resonance Skill Thrum of All Sounds is unlocked, which consumes 10% Thunder Rage per second:\nWhile on the ground, press Resonance Skill to launch up to 7 consecutive attacks:\n- The first 3 stages: Thrum of All Sounds: Spectro, dealing Spectro DMG.\n- The next 3 stages: Thrum of All Sounds: Havoc, dealing Havoc DMG.\n- The last 1 stages: Thrum of All Sounds: Silencing Blade, dealing Aero DMG.\nWhile on the ground, hold Resonance Skill to cast Thrum of All Sounds: Aero, dealing Aero DMG and leaping into the air.\nWhile airborne, press Resonance Skill to perform up to 6 stages of Mid-air Attacks:\n- The first 3 stages: Thrum of All Sounds: Havoc Mid-air Attack, dealing Havoc DMG.\n- The next 2 {Cus:Sap,S=stage P=stages SapTag=A}: Thrum of All Sounds: Aero Mid-air Attack, dealing Aero DMG and healing all nearby Resonators in the team.\n- The last 1 {Cus:Sap,S=stage P=stages SapTag=B}: Thrum of All Sounds: Aero Plunging Attack, dealing Aero DMG. Press Resonance Skill shortly after landing to cast Thrum of All Sounds: Silencing Blade.\nHold Resonance Skill in mid-air to cast Thrum of All Sounds: Aero Plunging Attack.\nEach time Thrum of All Sounds hits the target, Thunder Bane is triggered, dealing Electro DMG to the target within range, considered Resonance Skill DMG.\nWhile in Apex Resonance, press Resonance Skill shortly after casting a Basic Attack to chain into a specific Thrum of All Sounds skill based on the different Basic Attack Stages.\n\nElectric Surge\n\nRover can hold up to 120 points of Electric Surge.\nElectric Surge is restored when Intro Skill - Thunderous Fury, Normal Attack - Deterrence, Resonance Skill - Thunderclap, or Basic Attack - Repel deals damage.\n\nThunder Rage\n\nRover can hold up to 100 points of Thunder Rage.\nEntering Apex Resonance restores Thunder Rage to the max limit.\nThunder Rage is restored when Thrum of All Sounds deals damage.","actionIds":[1309022,1309023,1309024,1309025,1309026,1309027,1309028,1309029,1309030,1309031,1309032,1309033,1309034,1309035,1309036,1309038,1309039]},{"id":1005508,"type":"inherent","name":"Skillful Cooking","description":"Has a chance to produce special dishes when cooking.","actionIds":[]},{"id":1005509,"type":"outro","name":"Rumbling Thunders","description":"The incoming Resonator gains Electro Core for 20s or until the Resonator is switched out. After Resonators with Electro Core inflict Negative Statuses, their Electro Core is consumed, and they gain 25% All DMG Amplification for 14s. Switching to another Resonator ends the effect.\nCasting Outro Skill ends the Apex Resonance state and clears all Thunder Rage.","actionIds":[]},{"id":1005510,"type":"tuneBreak","name":"Tune Break - Sword","